"KStars provides an accurate graphical simulation of the night sky from any "
"location on Earth, and at any date and time. The display includes up to 100 "
"million stars, 13,000 deep-sky objects, all 8 planets, the Sun and Moon, and "
"thousands of comets, asteroids, supernovae, and satellites."
