#: content/for/scientists.md:169 content/for/students.md:115
msgid ""
"Navigation is also easy, as Kile constructs a list of all the chapters in "
"your document and then lets you use the list to jump to the corresponding "
"section."
msgstr ""

#: content/for/scientists.md:171 content/for/students.md:117
msgid ""
"You can also click in the viewer and jump to the corresponding LaTeX line in "
"the editor, or jump from the editor to the corresponding page in the viewer."
