#: content/for/students.md:27
msgid ""
"Our no-nonsense apps exist to help you get things done more quickly--not to "
"sell you subscriptions and useless products! From note-taking to complex "
"statistical computing, you can rely on KDE's apps and tools for your studies "
"and beyond."
msgstr ""

