msgid "KDE's Goals"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:0
msgid "KDE's Goals for the Next Couple of Years."
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:0
msgid "KGoals-logo.png"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:0
msgid "KDE Goals logo"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:10
msgid ""
"<div class=\"text-center\">\n"
"    <img src=\"https://kde.org/content/goals/KGoals-logo.png\" style="
"\"width:65%;height:65%;margin-bottom:70px\" alt=\"KDE Goals logo\" />\n"
"</div>\n"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:15
msgid ""
"KDE is a huge and diverse community working on hundreds of projects. To "
"guide our work, we have selected 3 overarching goals to focus on over the "
"next couple of years."
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:17
msgid ""
"<a class=\"button ms-1 me-1\" href=\"https://go.kde.org/matrix/#/#goals:kde."
"org\">Chat Room</a>"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:19
msgid "Streamlined Application Development Experience"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:21
msgid ""
"This goal focuses on improving the application development process. By "
"making it easier for developers to create applications, KDE hopes to attract "
"more contributors and deliver better software for both first-party and third-"
"party applications. A notable task within this goal is enhancing the "
"experience of building KDE apps with languages beyond C++, such as Rust or "
"Python."
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:23
msgid "**Champions: Nicolas Fella and Nate Graham**"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:25
msgid ""
"<a class=\"button mb-3 ms-1 me-1\" href=\"https://phabricator.kde.org/"
"T17396\">Proposal</a>"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:27
msgid "We care about your Input"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:29
msgid ""
"KDE has a diverse users base with unique input needs: artists using complex "
"monitor and drawing tablet setups; gamers with controllers, fancy mice, and "
"handhelds; users requiring accessibility features or using a language "
"optimally types with complex input methods; students with laptops, 2-in-1s, "
"and tablets — and more! While KDE has made significant progress in "
"supporting these diverse sources of input input over the years, there are "
"still gaps to be addressed. This goal aims to close those gaps and deliver a "
"truly seamless input experience for everyone."
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:31
msgid "**Champions: Gernot Schiller, Jakob Petsovits and Joshua Goins**"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:33
msgid ""
"<a class=\"button mb-3 ms-1 me-1\" href=\"https://phabricator.kde.org/"
"T17433\">Proposal</a>"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:35
msgid "KDE Needs You! 🫵"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:37
msgid ""
"KDE’s growth depends on new contributors, but a lack of fresh involvement in "
"key projects like Plasma, Kdenlive, Krita, GCompris, and others is a "
"concern. This goal focuses on formalizing and enhancing recruitment "
"processes, not just for individuals but also for institutions. Ensuring that "
"bringing in new talent becomes a continuous and community-wide priority, "
"vital for KDE's long-term sustainability."
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:39
msgid "**Champions: Aniqa Khokhar, Johnny Jazeix and Paul Brown**"
msgstr ""

#: content/goals/index.md:41
msgid ""
"<a class=\"button mb-3 ms-1 me-1\" href=\"https://phabricator.kde.org/"
"T17439\">Proposal</a>"
msgstr ""

